    <div class="container mt-4">

    <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Darth Vader</h1>
    <p>Sith Lord</p>
    </div> 

    <div class="row">
        
        <div class="col-md-6 character-info">
              <img src="https://wallpapercat.com/w/full/1/6/e/279814-3840x2160-desktop-4k-darth-vader-wallpaper-image.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded character-image" style="width: 100%; height: 600px; object-fit: cover;">
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 character-info">
            <h2>Backstory</h2>
            <p>Once known by the name Anakin Skywalker, a powerful Jedi who fell to the dark side of the Force.
                After suffering devastating injuries in a battle againts Obi-Wan Kenobi, Anakin was rebuilt and 
                transformed into Darth Vader, the most feared weapon of the Galatic Empire.
            </p>

            <h2>Abilities</h2>
            <p>Highly skilled lightsaber combatant. Force powers like force choke. 
                Enhanced physical strength and reflexes.
            </p>

            <h2>First Appearance</h2>
            <p>Darth Vader first appeared in Star Wars, released in 1977.</p>

            <h2>Personality Traits</h2>
            <p>Intimidating, disciplined, and ruthless. Known for his combat skills and devotion
                to the Galatic Empire. Struggles with his past memories as Anakin Skywalker.
            </p>
             </div>

    </div>

</div>
    
</body>
</html>